  "effectiveDate": "2013-06-14",
  "historyNote": "#7853, eff 3-12-03, EXPIRED: 3-12-11 New. #9942, INTERIM, eff 6-18-11, EXPIRED: 12-15-11 New. #10040-A, eff 12-16-11 (from Int 210.01); ss by #10359, eff 6-14-13",
